  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Peel and thinly slice orange into wedges.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Roughly chop roasted almonds.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb133cd318353e2a9a7d/step-789adc00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave brown, red & wild rice until steaming, 90 seconds. Transfer to a large bowl and allow to cool slightly.\n• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add the honey and a splash of water, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb133cd318353e2a9a7d/step-19af6210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the rice has cooled slightly, to the bowl, add spinach & rocket mix, cucumber, tomatoes, orange, a pinch of salt and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Toss until well combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb133cd318353e2a9a7d/step-82bb6320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide wild rice citrus salad between bowls.\n• Top with honey haloumi and drizzle over creamy pesto dressing.\n• Garnish with roasted almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb133cd318353e2a9a7d/step-62df1430.jpg"
    }
  ]
